  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "feat(json): introduce JsonModel and zero-allocation JSON pipeline\n\n      - Rewrite JsonExtensions to support zero-allocation serialization pipeline\n      - Reuse ThreadStatic Utf8JsonWriter to reduce intermediate allocations\n      - Add JsonModel for adaptive high-performance JSON manipulation\n      - Add JsonPath for direct JSON field access without full deserialization\n      - Support in-place JSON mutation with buffer patching\n      - Introduce adaptive JsonTape indexing for repeated field access\n      - Optimize single-field lookup with zero parse and zero intermediate allocation\n      - Preserve direct Span<byte> workflow for request/response processing\n      - Add benchmark suite for getter and setter performance\n      - Prepare infrastructure for future lookup modes and cache strategies",
